            "review_title": "Review at Le Financier Lounge",
            "review_text": "Nhu Anh\n2 contributions\n0\nNice place to chill\nMar 2023 • Couples\nThe rooftop is very nice and cosy to have a drink and eat some good food. The goose was tasty and delicious with the sauce. Also cocktails are good, specially the Black Mojito\nThe music is not loud so we can talk easily and that's a great point ! \nI'll come back for sure :)\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 8, 2023\nLe Financier\nThank you for your visit\nWritten March 17, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
