            "review_title": "Review at Le Financier Lounge",
            "review_text": "Ana\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n1\nAmazing!\nSep 2022\nAmazing new place in town🪩🤩 They have different types of food, including western food and Asian or Vietnamese food, wine, champagne, sparkling wine, cocktails, and beer. 🍸🍹🍺🥩Also, it’s super chill and cozy, there’re sofas and puff chairs to sit, relax and smoke shisha🪩💃🕺💨 Most importantly they don’t play loud music!!! Finally, there’s a place in Saigon where you can dance, talk and chill with not too loud music.🎶🎼🎸❤️‍🔥\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 27, 2022",
